# Meta-Controller-Node

This layer contains the stuff that is custom for the Artie Controller Module: its images
(artie-image-dev and artie-image-release), the packages only a controller node needs, and
each supported board's controller-node configuration (conf/artie-boards/<MACHINE>.conf).

Everything every Artie image needs is in meta-artie
(https://github.com/ArtieBots/meta-artie), which this layer depends on.
